{"2802740":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Heave Ho 2","steam_appid":2802740,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4926280],"detailed_description":"The bedlam is back, and now it’s online too. Grab and swing through all-new weird and wonderful worlds with up to four players in online and local co-op and versus play.<br><br>Take your partners by the hand (or head) and swing your ungainly chain from platform to pillar and beyond. Let go at the wrong moment and meet your splattery end, but a solid grip and pro swinging will take you over the finish line in sweet harmony!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2802740\/extras\/0a16f57ed9bfdfba33269174cf68b573.poster.avif?t=1790264315\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2802740\/extras\/0a16f57ed9bfdfba33269174cf68b573.webm?t=1790264315\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2802740\/extras\/0a16f57ed9bfdfba33269174cf68b573.mp4?t=1790264315\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online Pandemonium<\/h2>Adding to the game’s couch co-op roots, Heave Ho 2 takes the chaos online for the first time. Get a grip on faraway friends, then drop them into the void from a safe distance!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2802740\/extras\/50967398f31f01d879487e1cbf042aab.poster.avif?t=1790264315\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2802740\/extras\/50967398f31f01d879487e1cbf042aab.webm?t=1790264315\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.stea